<rml><head><title>Developer diagnostics</title><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/base.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/components.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/accessibility.rcss"/></head><body id="debug_root" class="c-fixture-page is-hidden"><div class="c-window"><div class="c-title-bar"><h1>Developer diagnostics</h1><button id="debug_close">Close</button></div><div class="c-toolbar"><button id="debug_tab_diagnostics">Counters</button><button id="debug_tab_gnomes">Gnomes</button><button id="debug_tab_items">Items</button><button id="debug_tab_game">Game</button></div><section id="debug_diagnostics"><p>Measured since the current world epoch. No thresholds are inferred.</p><div id="debug_counters"></div></section><section id="debug_gnomes" class="is-hidden"><input id="debug_search" type="text" placeholder="Search authoritative gnome list"/><button id="debug_refresh_gnomes">Refresh</button><div id="debug_gnome_rows" class="c-list c-scroll-region"></div></section><section id="debug_items" class="is-hidden"><button id="debug_refresh_groups">Load item groups</button><div id="debug_catalog"></div></section><section id="debug_game" class="is-hidden"><p>Authoritative game debug mutations require explicit typed controls; no player route exposes this document.</p></section></div></body></rml>
